  "policies": [
    "Cultist uses existing Taunt/Reborn and SELF_DAMAGED +3; Tar Tyrant uses Taunt/Lifesteal and CONTROLLER_OPPONENT_TURN +6. No extra condition executor.",
    "Chronicle Keeper queries current hand Dragon/all tribe metadata at its real Battlecry body and grants Taunt/Divine Shield only to its original continuous board resident.",
    "Bitter End freezes the originally captured physical adjacent group in board order, excluding inactive/location slots without skipping to farther neighbors. Its shared continuation checks injury of those original continuous residents after freeze reactions, then delegates destruction as one ordinary batch. Exact freeze/condition/reaction timing is a local M6 policy.",
    "Weapon after-hero-attack rewards use actual completed original character attack facts and the ordinary captured active weapon listener, including final durability wear before ordinary death cleanup. Damage uses ordinary non-spell damage; discard chooses highest current unselected hand cost with normal random ties, no fallback or invented payment.",
    "Auctioneer uses native Prepare and real spell_cast_started records, including hand/repeat/automatic casts and countered attempts. No-legal-target and other failed automatic attempts are excluded rather than treated as paid plays. Exact source/counter/automatic timing remains M6 policy.",
    "Waygate uses immutable original own starting physical inventory and current face_replaced, matching the existing Steamcleaner distinction. Original unchanged starting cards are excluded, new copies/stolen opposing originals and transformed original faces qualify. Unknown Scenario starting identity errors atomically. Current hand recipients remain original CardReferences across notifications. Exact face/transform qualification remains M6.",
    "Official TLC_101t related child is retained as full source evidence. Current Cultist face has no summon clause, so no invented summon or unproven reachable dependency is added; its catalog relation is not a registered executable child in this packet.",
    "Both dual classes, Frost school and weapon HEALTH durability are preserved from complete source/API comparison. Full Standard/Core/hotfix/reachable/generation and CN certification stay open; no eligible unknown candidate is removed."
  ]
